{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-communication","title":"显存与通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-experts/systems/memory-communication","wordCount":1608,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"显存与通信\">显存与通信</h1><p>MoE 把成本从计算转向显存和通信，这句话在工程账本上有非常具体的含义。一个稀疏模型的「便宜」只体现在 FLOPs；它的显存占用由<strong>总参数</strong>决定，它的多卡效率由 all-to-all <strong>带宽</strong>决定。这两笔账——显存账与通信账——往往才是决定一个 MoE 能不能训、能不能服务的真正约束。本篇把这两笔账算清楚：显存都花在哪、通信量怎么估、量化与卸载如何在「显存、延迟、质量」三角里腾挪。它是 <a href=\"expert-parallelism\">专家并行</a> 与 <a href=\"inference-serving\">推理与服务</a> 背后的资源底座。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>MoE 的显存由四块构成，且专家权重通常是最大的一块。下表给出训练态各部分的量级关系（以参数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为基准），可以看到为什么 MoE 显存如此吃紧：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>显存项</th>\n<th>量级</th>\n<th>MoE 特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模型权重</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto P_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>全量专家都要存，远大于激活量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化器状态</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto 2\\text{–}3 \\times P_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Adam 动量+方差，训练时最大头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>激活</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>active</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto P_{\\text{active}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">active</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>只与激活专家有关，相对小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KV cache（推理）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span></span></span></span></span> 序列长×batch</td>\n<td>与专家无关，但被专家挤占预算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  TOTAL[总显存预算] --&gt; W[专家权重&lt;br/&gt;正比总参数]&#10;  TOTAL --&gt; O[优化器状态&lt;br/&gt;训练态最大头]&#10;  TOTAL --&gt; A[激活&lt;br/&gt;正比激活参数]&#10;  TOTAL --&gt; KV[KV cache&lt;br/&gt;推理态]&#10;  W --&gt; Q{放不下?}&#10;  Q --&gt;|量化| QZ[fp8/int4 压权重]&#10;  Q --&gt;|卸载| OF[CPU/SSD 存冷专家]&#10;  QZ --&gt; FIT[纳入预算]&#10;  OF --&gt; FIT\">flowchart TD\n  TOTAL[总显存预算] --&gt; W[专家权重&lt;br/&gt;正比总参数]\n  TOTAL --&gt; O[优化器状态&lt;br/&gt;训练态最大头]\n  TOTAL --&gt; A[激活&lt;br/&gt;正比激活参数]\n  TOTAL --&gt; KV[KV cache&lt;br/&gt;推理态]\n  W --&gt; Q{放不下?}\n  Q --&gt;|量化| QZ[fp8/int4 压权重]\n  Q --&gt;|卸载| OF[CPU/SSD 存冷专家]\n  QZ --&gt; FIT[纳入预算]\n  OF --&gt; FIT</pre><h2 id=\"显存账-为什么稀疏模型反而更费显存\">显存账：为什么稀疏模型反而更费显存</h2><p>直觉上稀疏应该省，但显存的真相相反：MoE 用大量「沉睡」的专家权重换便宜的计算，这些权重不参与每个 token 的计算，却必须时刻可达。671B 的 DeepSeek-V3 即便只激活 37B，671B 的权重在训练时连同 Adam 优化器状态（约权重的 2–3 倍）会膨胀到数 TB 量级，远超任何单卡——这正是必须上专家并行分摊的根因。</p>\n<p>推理态优化器状态消失，但全量权重依旧。更隐蔽的是 KV cache 与权重抢显存：专家权重占得越多，留给 KV cache 的就越少，可承载的并发与上下文长度随之缩水。所以 MoE 服务的显存规划，本质是在「专家权重、KV cache、batch 容量」之间做三方分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通信账-带宽才是隐形天花板\">通信账：带宽才是隐形天花板</h2><p>通信账的主角是 all-to-all。每个 MoE 层一次前向要做 dispatch 与 combine 两次 all-to-all，其字节量约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mtext>bytes</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times T \\times k \\times d_{\\text{model}} \\times \\text{bytes}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bytes</span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 为 token 数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为激活专家数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{model}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为隐藏维）。层数越多、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 越大、跨节点越多，通信占比越高。</p>\n<p>关键在于 all-to-all 走的链路：节点内 NVLink 带宽是节点间 InfiniBand 的数倍乃至十倍，所以「token 是否跨节点」直接决定通信成本。DeepSeek 的节点受限路由、把热专家或共享专家在节点内复制、以及计算—通信重叠（见 <a href=\"expert-parallelism\">专家并行</a>），都是为了把昂贵的跨节点 all-to-all 压到最小。一条实用估算法则：当 all-to-all 字节量除以可用带宽的时间，超过专家 FFN 的计算时间，EP 就开始亏本，必须靠重叠或降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 来救。</p>\n<h2 id=\"量化与卸载-三角权衡里腾挪\">量化与卸载：三角权衡里腾挪</h2><p>当显存放不下，量化与卸载是两条主路，各有取舍。<strong>量化</strong>直接压缩权重精度：fp8 已成 2025–2026 大 MoE 的训练与推理常态（DeepSeek-V3 大量用 fp8 GEMM，但对路由等敏感算子保留高精度，见 <a href=\"../training/training-stability\">训练稳定性</a>），int4/int8 权重量化则在推理侧把专家显存再砍数倍，代价是可能的质量损失。</p>\n<p><strong>卸载</strong>把冷专家移到 CPU/SSD（见 <a href=\"inference-serving\">推理与服务</a> 的卸载系统），用换入延迟换显存。这两者本质都在同一个三角里腾挪：显存、延迟、质量，三者只能取其二。量化偏向「省显存 + 低延迟」但可能损质量；卸载偏向「省显存 + 不损质量」但增延迟；全量常驻偏向「低延迟 + 不损质量」但费显存。2025 下半年以来的旗舰开源 MoE 正是把这套组合拳用到极致的结果：Kimi K2 用约 1T 总参只带 32B 激活（激活占比约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.2\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.2%</span></span></span></span></span>，对应稀疏度约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>96.8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">96.8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">96.8%</span></span></span></span></span>），Qwen3-Next 更把激活占比压到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.8%</span></span></span></span></span>——总容量极大，而每 token 既省算力又靠量化（如 gpt-oss 的 MXFP4）与专家并行（及必要时的卸载）控住显存与延迟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个估算练习-deepseek-v3-的显存账\">一个估算练习：DeepSeek-V3 的显存账</h2><p>用 DeepSeek-V3 的 671B 总参做一次粗算，能把抽象的显存账落地。推理态只需权重：671B 参数若用 bf16（每参数 2 字节），约需 1.34 TB；改用 fp8（每参数 1 字节）则约 671 GB；再用 int4 权重量化可压到约 335 GB。即便最激进的 int4，单张 80GB 的 GPU 也远远放不下，必须用专家并行把专家铺到多卡——这就是为什么超大 MoE 的最小部署单元往往是一整台多卡服务器甚至多机。</p>\n<p>训练态更夸张：除权重外还要存 Adam 的一阶、二阶动量（各与权重同量级）与 fp32 主权重，优化器相关显存可达权重的数倍，整体逼近数 TB，这还没算激活与梯度。这就是为什么 MoE 训练几乎一定要叠加 ZeRO 式优化器状态分片、专家并行与流水并行。这个练习也直观说明了 <a href=\"../foundations/why-moe\">MoE 动机与稀疏激活</a> 里那句「成本转移」的分量——37B 的激活算力背后，是 671B 权重必须时刻可达的显存现实。量化把这堵墙降低，但降不平；卸载把墙挪到 CPU，但挪出延迟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MoE 显存由权重、优化器状态、激活、KV cache 四块构成，专家权重正比总参数，是稀疏模型反而更费显存的根因。</li>\n<li>训练态优化器状态约为权重 2–3 倍，连同全量权重逼出专家并行；推理态权重与 KV cache 争夺显存预算。</li>\n<li>通信账主角是两次 all-to-all，字节量正比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T\\cdot k\\cdot d_{\\text{model}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；跨节点与否（NVLink vs IB）决定成本，超过计算时间即亏本。</li>\n<li>量化（fp8/int4）与卸载（CPU/SSD）是显存超限的两条出路，本质都在「显存、延迟、质量」三角里取其二。</li>\n<li>这两笔账是专家并行与推理服务的资源底座，2025–2026 旗舰开源 MoE「万亿总参、个位数百分比激活占比」的规格，正是量化+卸载+EP 组合撑起来的。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.19437\">DeepSeek-V3 Technical Report (arXiv:2412.19437)</a>、<a href=\"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-120b\">gpt-oss-120b（Hugging Face: openai/gpt-oss-120b，MXFP4 权重量化）</a>、<a href=\"https://deepinfra.com/blog/mixture-of-experts-llm-economics-price-drop\">How MoE Changed LLM Economics (DeepInfra)</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"显存与通信","id":"显存与通信"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"显存账：为什么稀疏模型反而更费显存","id":"显存账-为什么稀疏模型反而更费显存"},{"level":2,"text":"通信账：带宽才是隐形天花板","id":"通信账-带宽才是隐形天花板"},{"level":2,"text":"量化与卸载：三角权衡里腾挪","id":"量化与卸载-三角权衡里腾挪"},{"level":2,"text":"一个估算练习：DeepSeek-V3 的显存账","id":"一个估算练习-deepseek-v3-的显存账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"推理与服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-experts/systems/inference-serving"},"next":{"title":"主流 MoE 大模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-experts/frontiers/moe-llms"}}